  "prefLabel": "En 1201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1201.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to simplify and standardize the administrative processes by which customers and utilities interact in order to increase the level of information and protection provided to both and ensure, as far as is possible, the equal application of these rules by all utilities.\n\nSource. #13986, eff 5-30-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 1200)",
